<title>USA: Nike Inc sells $200 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Nike Inc sells $200 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>Nike Inc was priced on Tuesday via Goldman Sachs &amp; Co, according</p>
<p>to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER: NIKE INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.375 PCT  MATURITY 12/1/03</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.575  FIRST PAY DATE 6/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 6.451 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 34 BPS    CALLABLE MAKE WHOLE CALL</p>
<p>						-- FLAT OVER TREASURIES</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1662</p>
</text>
